Subject: [PATCH] Change hook type

---
 KernelSU-Next/kernel/supercall/dispatch.c | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/KernelSU-Next/kernel/supercall/dispatch.c b/KernelSU-Next/kernel/supercall/dispatch.c
index 927240415aa1..f1f6263880a3 100644
